Pre-existing, found during k191: CRD.pm _apply_options writes enum/pattern/minimum/maximum of an [X] array and of a typed map (now also HashRef[Str]) onto the container schema instead of items / additionalProperties. The emitted CRD then constrains the array/object itself, not its values.
